      "$comment": "Daily plan shown on the Dashboard. Internal training schedule, not an ETS recommendation. Days are counted before the exam date (J-n). Tasks: a task type, 'focus' (Focus weaknesses) or 'simulation:<scope>[:short]'. Block durations are estimated from drill_seconds (+ audio and response windows) and checked by validatePlan().",
